@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP systems. Restore an actual functional decomposition rather than reuse a whole-system context image.
title MVP functional decomposition — separate responsibilities
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 190
rectangle "Version 1 = MVP" as M
rectangle "Core\nF01 invited identity / dashboard\nF02 profile / independent resumes / portfolio\nF03 PDF / selected protected sharing\nF04 manual applications / actual materials / follow-up\nF09 private same-server files / audit / recovery" as C
rectangle "Separate ProjectForge\nF06 issues / simple Kanban\nF07 native Git / permissions / file-history" as P #DCF2E5
rectangle "AFTER MVP\nF05 independent private communications\nAdvanced F06 backlog / Sprints\nAdvanced F07 review / merge / releases\nF08 YAML execution / deployment; AI" as F #F8EBD7
M --> C : current core responsibilities
M --> P : current API-connected system
C <--> P : authenticated user-scoped API
M ..> F : future scope only; no MVP dependency
@enduml
